// Title: Suspicious Process By Web Server Process
// Rule ID: 8202070f-edeb-4d31-a010-a26c72ac5600
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.initial-access, attack.t1505.003, attack.t1190
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_webshell_susp_process_spawned_from_webserver.yml
//
